        "URL": "https://timestabloid.com/market-strategist-dont-sleep-on-xrp-heres-why/",
        "BODY": "The cryptocurrency market often rewards those who pay attention to subtle shifts before they explode into mainstream awareness. While Bitcoin continues to dominate headlines, seasoned traders know that true opportunities often arise when attention is elsewhere. XRP, Ripple’s digital asset for global payments, is quietly gaining renewed traction—and analysts warn investors not to overlook what could be one of the next major momentum plays. A Market Reawakening Beneath the Surface Periods of low volatility can be deceptive. They often mask the accumulation phase preceding a strong breakout. That’s the quiet space where altcoins like XRP tend to regain strength. As the market digests the latest macro developments and ETF-driven liquidity cycles, XRP has maintained steady on-chain activity, growing institutional engagement, and signs of returning investor confidence—all while trading under historical resistance levels. Don’t Sleep on #XRP pic.twitter.com/SVIzEEbfRF — Levi | Crypto Crusaders (@LeviRietveld) October 16, 2025 Tom Bruni Highlights XRP and Ethereum as Top Altcoins to Watch In a recent CoinDesk interview clip shared on X by Levi Rietveld, Tom Bruni, a market strategist and head of markets at Stocktwits, identified XRP alongside Ethereum as the two altcoins drawing renewed investor attention. “Bitcoin will always remain a core portion of people’s portfolios,” Bruni noted, “but Ethereum and Ripple (XRP) are two of the altcoins that people are watching for confirmation of a new breath of momentum coming into this market.” This recognition places XRP among a select few assets that analysts believe could lead the next rotation of capital in the altcoin market. Bruni’s comments were shared by Levi Rietveld, a respected crypto commentator on X, who emphasized the strategic importance of XRP’s position in the evolving market landscape. His post reignited conversation within the XRP community, amplifying investor interest in Ripple’s ecosystem and its long-term potential. Regulatory Clarity Strengthens Ripple’s Position A crucial catalyst supporting renewed optimism around XRP is the steady clearing of legal uncertainty surrounding Ripple. Following a series of pivotal rulings and courtroom developments in 2023 and 2025, Ripple and the U.S. SEC have formally brought an end to the years-long litigation that clouded XRP’s regulatory status. We are on X, follow us to connect with us :- @TimesTabloid1 — TimesTabloid (@TimesTabloid1) June 15, 2025 This resolution has reshaped institutional sentiment. With clearer legal boundaries, Ripple has accelerated enterprise partnerships and cross-border payment integrations through RippleNet and its RLUSD stablecoin. The company’s recent acquisition of GTreasury , a SWIFT-certified treasury management platform , further aligns Ripple with global banking networks—an integration that could significantly enhance XRP’s utility in international finance. The Technical and Sentiment Outlook While XRP’s price has consolidated in recent weeks, the underlying sentiment metrics tell a different story. Social engagement has climbed following Rietveld’s viral post, and trading volume on major exchanges has shown a modest but steady uptick. Historical data suggests XRP often precedes sharp upward movements following similar phases of accumulation. Market watchers are eyeing critical resistance zones near previous highs, where a confirmed breakout could validate Bruni’s thesis of a “new breath of momentum.” As traders reassess portfolio allocations, XRP’s combination of regulatory clarity, institutional adoption, and community-driven momentum positions it as a key altcoin to watch closely. The Case for Not Sleeping on XRP The message from top analysts is consistent—ignore XRP at your peril. It may no longer command the speculative hype of earlier cycles, but it is gaining something far more valuable: credibility, clarity, and real-world adoption. As Tom Bruni and Levi Rietveld highlighted, XRP stands at a strategic crossroads of regulation, technology, and liquidity. For investors looking beyond short-term noise, XRP’s current calm may well be the precursor to its next major move. In markets like crypto, the quiet phases often separate those who sleep from those who seize the opportunity. Disclaimer : This content is meant to inform and should not be considered financial advice. The views expressed in this article may include the author’s personal opinions and do not represent Times Tabloid’s opinion. Readers are urged to do in-depth research before making any investment decisions. Any action taken by the reader is strictly at their own risk. Times Tabloid is not responsible for any financial losses. Follow us on Twitter , Facebook , Telegram , and Google News The post Market Strategist: Don’t Sleep on XRP. Here’s Why appeared first on Times Tabloid .",
