        "BODY": "Binance has announced the launch of two new USDⓈ-M perpetual futures contracts, LABUSDT and RIVERUSDT, to expand trading options and enhance user experience on its futures platform. Binance Futures Launches LABUSDT and RIVERUSDT Perpetual Trading Contracts The launch dates of the new contracts are as follows: LABUSDT Perpetual Contract: October 17, 2025, 14:30 – 50x leverage RIVERUSDT Perpetual Contract: October 17, 2025, 14:45 – 50x leverage According to Binance's statement, LAB (LAB) and RIVER (RIVER) tokens are already listed on Binance Alpha Market. LAB, a multi-chain trading infrastructure, combines spot, limit, and futures trading with an AI research engine. The platform aims to provide high-performance order execution and strategic trading tools. RIVER is building the first chain abstraction stablecoin system that provides cross-chain asset, liquidity, and yield integration. Both contracts will be exchanged for USDT and offer 24-hour trading. The funding rate cap is +/- 2%, and funding fees will be collected every four hours. The new contracts will be eligible for the Binance Futures New Listing Fee Promotion and will be included in the Futures Copy Trading feature within 24 hours of launch. Binance stated that it may update contract parameters such as leverage ratio, tick size, margin requirements, or funding fees as needed based on market risk conditions. Additionally, thanks to the Multi-Assets Mode feature, users will be able to use these contracts by trading with different collateral assets (e.g. BTC). *This is not investment advice. Continue Reading: Binance Announces Listing of Two New Altcoin Trading Pairs on its Futures Platform! Here Are the Details",
