ediate downside support, while the upper band at $0.8659 marks a distant resistance range. The price remains pinned below the mid-band, signaling a persistently weak trend. OPUSDT 1-day price chart by TradingView The MACD indicator confirms sustained bearish momentum with the histogram printing consecutive red bars, though their decreasing size suggests sellers may be losing steam. Volume remains moderate, which means any sudden shift could accelerate the next move. If OP loses the $0.36 support, the next zone to watch would be $0.32–$0.30. Conversely, a recovery above $0.45 could signal the beginning of a short-term reversal, opening room toward $0.52–$0.60. Optimism 4-hour price chart On the 4-hour chart, OP trades at $0.413, showing signs of sideways consolidation after heavy selling. The Alligator indicator lines are widely separated and angled downward, confirming the existing downtrend, but the green jaw line flattening near $0.43 hints at a potential slowdown. OPUSDT 4-hour price chart by TradingView The RSI at 32.58 places OP near the oversold boundary, implying sellers might soon run out of momentum. The OBV reading of -66.05M confirms consistent outflows, but the recent flattening in OBV indicates the selling volume could be tapering off. If buying pressure emerges near $0.40, we could see a minor bounce toward $0.44–$0.46, which coincides with the short-term resistance cluster. A clean break above $0.46 could shift momentum briefly bullish. However, a breakdown below $0.39 would invalidate any recovery prospects and resume the bearish leg. Optimism technical indicators: Levels and action Daily simple moving average (SMA) Period Value Action SMA 3 $0.5457 SELL SMA 5 $0.5224 SELL SMA 10 $0.5823 SELL SMA 21 $0.6472 SELL SMA 50 $0.6959 SELL SMA 100 $0.7105 SELL SMA 200 $0.7445 SELL Daily exponential moving average (EMA) Period Value Action EMA 3 $0.6370 SELL EMA 5 $0.6668 SELL EMA 10 $0.6927 SELL EMA 21 $0.7099 SELL EMA 50 $0.7080 SELL EMA 100 $0.7178 SELL EMA 200 $0.8540 SELL What to expect from Optimism? Optimism is still under bearish control but may be approaching an accumulation floor between $0.36–$0.40. A rebound toward $0.50 remains plausible if volume strengthens, though failure to hold above $0.40 could invite another downward leg before any real recovery takes shape. Is Optimism a good crypto investment? Optimism (OP) could be a good investment if you believe in Ethereum scaling and the growth of Layer 2 solutions. However, like all crypto, it’s risky, and its value depends on adoption and market trends. Only invest what you’re willing to lose! Will OP recover? A recovery is possible, but we fear the overall bearish sentiment makes a short-term rebound unlikely. However, as the market consolidates, we expect reduced volatility, which may lead to a breakout in either direction, depending on market dynamics. Will Optimism reach $10? Yes, Optimism is projected to close up to $10 by 2028. Will OP reach $50? Reaching $50 for Optimism (OP) would be an ambitious target, requiring a significant increase in its price. This level would likely only be achievable in a highly favorable market environment, with substantial advancements in Ethereum adoption, widespread use of Layer 2 solutions, and strong overall market growth. Will OP reach $100? Reaching $100 for Optimism (OP) would be extremely ambitious and require unprecedented growth and adoption. Does Optimism have a good long-term future? Yes, Optimism shows strong potential for growth and sustained interest, indicating a positive long-term outlook. Recent news/opinion on Optimism Superchain networks built on Optimism’s OP Stack now power 58.5% of all L2 transactions. The Superchain is scaling Ethereum and the data tells the story. 🔗 Explore the dashboard → https://t.co/lZGg3jXlB6 Superchain networks built on Optimism's OP Stack, including OP Mainnet, @base , @inkonchain , @soneium , @unichain , and others, now power 58.5% of all L2… pic.twitter.com/w90faoFL7C — Optimism (@Optimism) October 16, 2025 Optimism price prediction October 2025 Optimism’s price prediction for October 2025 suggests a potential low of $0.333, an average of $0.43, and a high of $0.61. Optimism price prediction Potential Low Potential Average Potential High Optimism price prediction October 2025 $0.333 $0.43 $0.61 Optimism price prediction 2025 The price of Optimism is predicted to reach a maximum value of $2.05 in 2025. Traders can anticipate a minimum price of $0.311 and an average trading price of $0.99. Optimism price prediction Potential Low Potential Average Potential High Optimism price prediction 2025 $0.311 $0.99 $2.05 Optimism price predictions 2026–2031 Year Minimum Price ($) Average Price ($) Maximum Price ($) 2026 4.49 4.64 5.14 2027 6.36 6.54 7.7 2028 9.37 9.69 11.14 2029 13.6 14.08 16.38 2030 18.79 19.49 23.62 2031 27.9 28.88 33.66 Optimism price prediction 2026 In 2026, the price of Optimism is forecasted to be around $4.64. OP’s value can reach a maximum of $5.14 and an average trading value of $4.64. Optimism price prediction 2027 In 2027, Optimism price prediction suggests a maximum price of $7.70, an average trading price of $6.54, and a minimum price of $6.36. Optimism price prediction 2028 Per the Optimism price forecast for 2028, OP could reach a peak price of $11.14. The average price is projected to stabilize around $9.69, with a minimum expected at $9.37. Optimism price prediction 2029 The Optimism price prediction for 2029 suggests a peak value of $16.38. The minimum trading price is expected to be $13.60. The average market value is projected to be around $14.08. Optimism price prediction 2030 The Optimism forecast for 2030 suggests a minimum price of $18.79, a maximum price of $23.62, and an average price of $19.49. Optimism price prediction 2031 According to the Optimism price prediction for 2031, OP could potentially reach a maximum price of $33.66, a minimum price of $27.90, and an average value of around $28.88. Optimism 